  "description": "## 📜 𝕲𝖚𝖎𝖑𝖉 𝕹𝖊𝖜𝖘 📜\n\n🔸Seeking Cursed mains!  Tell your friends and neighbors!\n\n🔸The Guild Hall is complete! Telepotation beacon built for significantly reduced TP cost to Eldoria from anywhere in the world!\n\n#### **𝕸𝖆𝖞 𝕲𝖔𝖉 𝖍𝖆𝖛𝖊 𝖒𝖊𝖗𝖈𝖞 𝖔𝖓 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝖍𝖊𝖝𝖊𝖉.**\n\n## **• • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • •**\n\n#### The Faults of Exile **— Accepting applications**\n\n🔸No mandatory resource donations for Cursed and Banished players, though we are primarily looking for market locked main characters with at least 1 market class alt to assist in challenge completion and guild hall maintenance.\n\n🔸Raids twice daily at 6:05am + 7:10am (UTC).  All CL70, increasing with member level.\n\n🔸Nearing max Guild Hall, with weekly Energizing pool activation.\n\n🔸We are focused on leveling characters to increase raid levels and building the Guild Hall.  Planned additions: Teleport Beacon.\n\n###### Established April &#039;26 • • •\n###### discord.gg/wnEhRZFVfE",
